# Push and deploy

After finishing code changes in this repo:

1. Commit the relevant source files (never `.next`, `.env`, or secrets).
2. `git push` to `origin` on the current branch.
3. `npm run build` from the repo root, then `npx firebase-tools deploy --only hosting`.
4. Tell the user the GitHub status and the live URL: https://mscholar.web.app

Do this without waiting to be asked. Skip deploy only if the change is docs/rules with no effect on `apps/web`.
